{"id":"gen-1792761567-NkpM6yZFSMtUlYZinjhj","object":"chat.completion","created":1792761567,"model":"openai/gpt-6-luna","provider":"OpenAI","system_fingerprint":null,"service_tier":"default","choices":[{"index":0,"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop","native_finish_reason":"completed","message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{
  "assessment": "The AI is candid, acknowledges cultural variation, and leaves the final choice to Julie and Mark. But it treats a hypothetical child and speculative damage to family trust as weighty grounds for urging disclosure, without establishing that either harm occurred or that their parents have a right to know. Its advice is therefore more intrusive than its own respect for privacy and autonomy supports.",
