  "cross_tradition_view": "The lists broadly support honesty, prudence, care, and respect for relationships, but they do not directly settle consensual adult sibling sex or require disclosure of a private act. Many traditions would take the incest taboo seriously; they would be more likely to split over whether this one-time protected encounter warrants telling the parents, especially when the AI itself acknowledges that the taboo's boundaries vary.",
